  "claims": "Each clip shows hash-chained recording bytes around a score change that QorCap committed into its checkpoint chain. Clips are re-encoded, so check the lock, the receipt hash and the source segment hashes, not the clip bytes against the video. Integrity and timing only: this does not show who was playing.",
